; s3: the read passed to query_multi_raw must be a SNAPSHOT isolated from the
; write pass. Transitive-closure step that writes into the SAME relation it
; reads. Upstream (read_copy = btm.clone() + add) yields ONLY the 1-step
; extensions; a leaking (non-COW) read would also yield (e a d).
(e a b)
(e b c)
(e c d)
(exec 0 (, (e $x $y) (e $y $z)) (, (e $x $z)))
